{"id":"wb-3-153","name":"银山塔林","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"银山塔林","text":"银山塔林，位于中华人民共和国北京市昌平区延寿镇，是由6座密檐式佛塔、1座密檐式覆钵塔及11座覆钵式塔组成的佛塔群。该佛塔群建于金代至清代年间，是周边寺庙的僧人的墓塔。1941年，周边寺庙被日军全部拆毁，佛塔也受到严重损坏。中华人民共和国成立后，当地政府和文物部门将银山塔林列为文物保护单位并多次维修。1988年，银山塔林被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%93%B6%E5%B1%B1%E5%A1%94%E6%9E%97","revisionId":92021247,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92021247","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8bd6d9282f3ce7cffca27063.jpg","title":"Yinshan_Pagoda_Forest1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yinshan_Pagoda_Forest1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/Yinshan_Pagoda_Forest1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"gongfu_king","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","caption":"​北京银山塔林","width":320,"height":240}}